*** Keywords ***
CB008990_DFE-DFE_link_fault
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check if system correctly raises fault in WebEM accordingly to raised internal alarms
    ...  related to DFE-DFE link failures.
    ...  The test is intended for the following RMODs: AKQJ
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD runtime id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param dict throughputs: (Mandatory) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                         it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                         defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                         Example:
    ...                                            {
    ...                                              '827736065':
    ...                                                    {
    ...                                                       'throughput':
    ...                                                           {
    ...                                                               'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                           },
    ...                                                       'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                   },
    ...                                          }
    ...  :param list called_cells_distnames: (Optional) : CONFIGURATION distnames of cells that will be called, if not given,
    ...                                                   list of all cells on testline will be determined and called
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param int tput_duration (Optional) : duration of data transfer in seconds; defaults to 30
    ...  :param bool tput_verification_via_btslog: (Optional) : True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                         False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                                             possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                             when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                             with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                             mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None8", "ssb_32",
    ...                                             default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action' alarm activation/deactivation, defaults to 60.

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${throughputs}
    ...            ${called_cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${tput_duration}=30
    ...            ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...            ${timeout}=60

    [Timeout]      24 hours

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${recovery_reset_delay}                                 Get Recovery Reset Delay
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be True	                                        ${recovery_reset_delay}>=60
    ...                                                     msg=SCF parameter 'recovery_reset_delay' should be equal 60 at least.

    Execute L3 call
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     duration=${tput_duration}s
    ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    Disable DFE-DFE Link
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Alarms.Allow alarm                                      fault_id=1904
    Allow additional alarms if recovery delay is longer than 30s
    ...                                                     recovery_reset_delay=${recovery_reset_delay}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for alarm 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action' (fault id: '1904') to become active...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             ${timeout}
    ...                                                     10s
    ...                                                     Check if alarm is active
    ...                                                     fault_name=Radio autonomous reset as recovery action
    ...                                                     fault_id=1904
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                                        Alarm 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action' (fault id: '1904') is active.

    Enable DFE-DFE Link
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for alarm 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action' (fault id: '1904') to become inactive...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             ${timeout}
    ...                                                     10s
    ...                                                     Check if alarm is inactive
    ...                                                     fault_name=RF BB bus synchronization error
    ...                                                     fault_id=1904
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Result                                        Alarm 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action' (fault id: '1904') is inactive.

    Wait for Radio autonomous reset Action                  rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     recovery_reset_delay=${recovery_reset_delay}

    Check status of RMOD and cells during RMOD startup after recovery action
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     rmod_startup_time=300

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                   fault_id=1904
    Disallow additional alarms if recovery delay is longer than 30s
    ...                                                     recovery_reset_delay=${recovery_reset_delay}

    Execute L3 call
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     duration=${tput_duration}s
    ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

Disable DFE-DFE Link
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Disabling of DFE-DFE link via fronthaul on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    ${action_result}                                        rmod_ops.execute_ssh_command
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     command=sudo ifconfig arb0p2 down
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Should Not Contain Any                                  ${action_result}
    ...                                                     Operation not permitted
    ...                                                     fail
    ...                                                     error
    ...                                                     msg=Disabling of DFE-DFE link is not completed.
    Robot Log Result                                        Disabling of DFE-DFE link is completed.

Enable DFE-DFE Link
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Enabling of DFE-DFE link via fronthaul on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    ${action_result}                                        rmod_ops.execute_ssh_command
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     command=sudo ifconfig arb0p2 up
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Should Not Contain Any                                  ${action_result}
    ...                                                     Operation not permitted
    ...                                                     fail
    ...                                                     error
    ...                                                     msg=Disabling of DFE-DFE link is not completed.
    Robot Log Result                                        Enabling of DFE-DFE link is completed.
